      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Known issue, heard it’s currently being worked out according to orels1. I won’t speak on behalf but they’ve been looking into this special case.\n\nIn the meantime, it’s typically good practice to put your Scripts into your own personal folder directory. Put them in something like `Assets/n8bits/UdonSharp Scripts` or similar.",
